        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You emit a bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim light for the next 20 feet. You take a –2 item penalty to Stealth checks to Hide and Sneak."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When you activate "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "major golden wings",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", you also gain a fly Speed of 20 feet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When you activate "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "true golden wings",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", you also gain a fly Speed equal to your Speed or 25 feet, whichever is greater."
          }
        ]
      }
